{
  "name": "Schedule social media posts from a Google Sheets calendar, checked before they go out",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule posts from a Google Sheets content calendar\n\nFor teams that plan social posts in a spreadsheet and want each one checked before it is scheduled, not when it fails at publishing time.\n\n### How it works\n1. Every 15 minutes the workflow reads rows whose **Status** is `Ready`.\n2. A **Media URL** is uploaded to Preflight first, which measures the image or video.\n3. Preflight checks text, link and media against the rules of every channel in the row.\n4. Rows that pass are scheduled for **Publish At**, or queued for the next free slot when it is empty. The row gets `Scheduled` and the Preflight post ID.\n5. Rows that fail get `Needs fix` and the reason, e.g. \"Text is 385 characters; Bluesky allows 300.\"\n\n### Setup\n1. Needs the verified community node **Preflight** ([n8n-nodes-preflight](https://www.npmjs.com/package/n8n-nodes-preflight) 0.1.1 or later): search for Preflight in the nodes panel and choose Install. Tested on n8n 2.43.\n2. In [Preflight](https://preflight.social) (the free plan works), connect your social accounts, then create an API key under Settings → API keys with the scopes `posts:read`, `posts:write`, `posts:publish`, `media:read` and `media:write`. Add it as a **Preflight API** credential in the four Preflight nodes.\n3. Make a sheet with a tab named `Posts` and this header row:\n`Text | Channels | Publish At | Media URL | Link | Status | Preflight Post ID | Issues`\n4. In **Configuration**, paste the sheet's URL. Add a Google Sheets credential to the four Sheets nodes.\n\n### Customization\n- **Channels**: network names such as `bluesky, linkedin`, or `platform:channelId` for two accounts on one network. Empty uses **defaultChannels** from Configuration.\n- **Publish At** (`2026-11-02 09:30`) is read in the workflow's time zone, set under Workflow settings.",
        "height": 960,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "bb9bae5e-7e6c-55cd-8ea2-df36504bb9e0",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -800,
        -420
      ]
    },
