        700,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Check, then schedule or queue\nThe idempotency key is the row and a hash of its text, so a row never becomes two posts.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 1440,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "6fd6725c-be12-53d9-9dfe-3563fee6e36b",
      "name": "Section: check and schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1400,
        -440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4. Write the result back\nA refusal or an API error lands in **Issues** so the row can be fixed and set to Ready again.",
